tinacloud-completion-fish(1) -- Generate fish completion script
===============================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Generate a fish completion script.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud completion fish`

## EXAMPLES

	$ tinacloud completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/tinacloud.fish

